WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Clinote logbook home screen.

00:02.000 --> 00:04.500
Record a description of a procedure.

00:04.500 --> 00:06.000
The recording is transcribed.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
Review the text before extracting details.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
Clinote extracts the structured log fields.

00:10.000 --> 00:17.500
Review the procedure, role, indication, plan and findings.

00:17.500 --> 00:20.000
Save the reviewed log entry.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.934
The saved entry appears on the timeline.
